{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Restorative Sound Baths</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Invitation to immersive sound gatherings, private harmonics, and gentle practices to help you settle, reset, and celebrate." />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body class="clinic-modern">
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="brand">
      <svg class="logo" viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">
        <defs>
          <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1">
            <stop offset="0" stop-color="#7ed6df" />
            <stop offset="1" stop-color="#6c5ce7" />
          </linearGradient>
        </defs>
        <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="40" fill="url(#g1)"/>
        <g fill="#fff" transform="translate(20,20)">
          <rect x="0" y="30" width="60" height="6" rx="3"/>
          <circle cx="10" cy="10" r="8"/>
          <circle cx="40" cy="10" r="8"/>
        </g>
      </svg>
      <div>
        <h1 class="business">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>
        <p class="tag">{{TAGLINE}}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav class="main-nav">
      <a href="events.html">Gatherings</a>
      <a href="private-sessions.html">Private Harmonics</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Invest</a>
      <a href="about.html">Our Story</a>
      <a href="faq.html">Curiosities</a>
      <a href="book.html" class="cta">Reserve</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Reach Out</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <!-- HERO + Mood-to-Method -->
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="pattern-wrap">
        <svg class="pattern" role="img" aria-hidden="true">
          <use href="assets/img/pattern.svg#pattern" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-content">
        <h2>Float into focused calm — live sound sessions that meet you where you are.</h2>
        <p class="lead">Softly amplified bowls, layered tones, and guided rests to help breath, body, and mind find a new shape.</p>

        <div class="selectors">
          <div class="selector mood">
            <label for="mood">How are you right now?</label>
            <select id="mood">
              <option value="restless">Restless — mind on loop</option>
              <option value="anxious">Anxious — chest tight</option>
              <option value="tired">Tired — hard to move</option>
              <option value="reflective">Reflective — open to insight</option>
              <option value="celebratory">Celebratory — joyful release</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div class="selector intensity">
            <label>Sound preference</label>
            <div class="mixer" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Intensity">
              <label><input type="radio" name="intensity" value="gentle" checked> Gentle</label>
              <label><input type="radio" name="intensity" value="medium"> Medium</label>
              <label><input type="radio" name="intensity" value="intense"> Intense</label>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="recommendation" id="recommendation">
          <h3 class="program-name">Program suggestion</h3>
          <p class="program-desc">Choose a mood and a sound level to see a tailored suggestion. The page will update the action to match.</p>
          <div class="program-meta">
            <span class="price">—</span>
            <span class="duration">—</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-cts">
          <a id="primaryCta" class="primary-cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a class="secondary-cta" href="events.html">See next Gatherings</a>
        </div>

        <p class="disclaimer">Contraindications: Sound baths are generally safe but not recommended during pregnancy without provider approval, around unmanaged seizures, or when acute inner-ear conditions or severe psychiatric symptoms are present. If you have health concerns, check with your physician. For immediate medical crises, call emergency services.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- GALLERY -->
    <section class="gallery">
      <h3>Textures of the room</h3>
      <p>We craft layered fields of sound — singing bowls, chimes, breath-led vocal tones, and textured silence. Below are sonic vignettes represented as visual soundforms.</p>
      <div class="grid">
        <figure class="card"><div class="visual v1"></div><figcaption>Evening Drift — bowl-led meditation</figcaption></figure>
        <figure class="card"><div class="visual v2"></div><figcaption>Midday Reset — short focus bath</figcaption></figure>
        <figure class="card"><div class="visual v3"></div><figcaption>Resonant Release — layered harmonics</figcaption></figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- WHAT TO EXPECT (order changed) -->
    <section class="what-to-expect">
      <h3>What happens here?</h3>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Arrive & Settle:</strong> Soft lighting, cushions, and a gentle orientation.</li>
        <li><strong>Intention & Breath:</strong> Short guided centering to arrive in the present.</li>
        <li><strong>The Sound Field:</strong> 30–60 minutes of curated tones. You may rest, move, or do gentle stretches.</li>
        <li><strong>Grounding:</strong> We land together with a quiet prompt and time to reorient.</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="note">Sessions work best with loose, comfortable clothing and an openness to non-goal experience.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- OBJECTIONS -->
    <section class="objections">
      <h3>Not sure? Quick answers</h3>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <div class="qa"><strong>Will I fall asleep?</strong><p>Maybe — and that can be restorative. If you need wakeful focus, pick a medium or intense mix.</p></div>
        <div class="qa"><strong>Is this religious?</strong><p>No. These gatherings use sound and breath as tools; they're accessible to people of any background.</p></div>
        <div class="qa"><strong>I'm sensitive to noise — will this be loud?</strong><p>We tailor volume and vibration to the room and to participant needs. Use the "gentle" setting to prioritize soft, long tones.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="final-cta">
      <div class="cta-card">
        <h3>Ready to join a session?</h3>
        <p>We run small, attentive gatherings and private harmonics. Book a single session or a three-part wave-series to notice gradual change.</p>
        <a id="bookingCta" class="booking-cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
        <p class="small">Prefer to talk it through? Call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> or email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- events teaser with next event module + mini calendar list -->
    <aside class="events-teaser">
      <h4>Next Gathering</h4>
      <div class="next-event" id="nextEvent">
        <strong>Loading next event…</strong>
      </div>
      <ul class="mini-calendar" id="miniCalendar">
        <!-- populated by JS -->
      </ul>
      <a href="events.html" class="link">Full calendar</a>
    </aside>

  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div>
      <p>&copy; <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — <span class="city">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</span></p>
      <p><a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a> · <a href="contact.html">Contact</a></p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>"} 
